WEBVTT

00:12.970 --> 00:18.710
Hikari ga sasu sora, umareochiru kage
In the bright sky illuminated by
sunlight, darkened shadows are born.

00:18.810 --> 00:24.150
Unmei wa dokomademo hikisakareru
Fate itself is being torn apart.

00:25.190 --> 00:30.150
Donna toki mo kesshite akiramenainara
If you never give up, no matter what happens,

00:30.330 --> 00:37.560
mada tozasareteru tobira kanarazu hiraku
Even that locked door will open for you.

00:38.530 --> 00:43.990
Eien datte dakishimete, fuuin mo tokihanachi
Embrace eternity and release the seal.

00:44.070 --> 00:49.940
Mamorubekimono ga ima kokoni wa arukara
Because the ones you wish
to protect are right here.

00:49.940 --> 00:55.880
Namida mo gyutto dakishimete,
yasashisa de tsutsumikomi
Embrace their tears with kindness.

00:55.880 --> 01:01.560
Nagareru mizu no youni tsuyoku nare
Become strong like the formless water,

01:01.560 --> 01:07.550
omouyouni tsuyoku nare
Become as strong as you wish to be.

01:07.700 --> 01:13.170
Mou jibun ni obienaide
Stop being afraid of yourself.

01:13.170 --> 01:19.800
Sou mirai wo osorenaide
Do not fear the future.

01:33.350 --> 01:34.760
"Loitering?"

01:34.760 --> 01:36.260
Shopping Mall Lottery

01:36.260 --> 01:36.930
Shopping Mall Lottery
No, "lottery."

01:36.930 --> 01:37.520
No, "lottery."

01:38.730 --> 01:42.130
You draw lots to win the
prizes on display over there.

01:45.070 --> 01:46.730
The Autumn Harvest Pack.

01:47.070 --> 01:50.400
I want that! You have to win it, Toru!

01:50.610 --> 01:51.440
I know.

01:51.510 --> 01:53.340
Ku. You draw the lot.

01:53.340 --> 01:57.840
Fox deities are like gods of the harvest, right?
You should have better luck than us.

01:58.050 --> 01:59.380
He's right, Ku-chan.

01:59.380 --> 02:00.870
We're counting on you.

02:00.950 --> 02:02.470
All right!

02:04.820 --> 02:06.090
I won't ask for much.

02:06.090 --> 02:08.490
Just please let it be more than
the tissue consolation prize.

02:16.430 --> 02:19.600
Congratulations! You won first prize!

02:19.600 --> 02:20.660
What prize?

02:22.770 --> 02:24.430
The hot springs trip...

02:24.570 --> 02:26.130
She won it...

02:26.470 --> 02:27.380
Hot springs?

02:27.380 --> 02:30.670
But I wanted the Autumn Harvest Pack.

02:30.850 --> 02:33.510
This is amazing! You did it, Ku!

02:33.680 --> 02:35.440
Thanks, Ku-chan!

02:38.420 --> 02:43.380
Our Fox Deity, Takes a Trip

02:48.600 --> 02:49.930
Ku, check.

02:50.530 --> 02:51.760
Ko, check.

02:52.070 --> 02:54.970
Don't point. It's rude.

02:55.970 --> 03:00.910
Just thinking about how we've come a long
way since the first time you rode the train.

03:00.910 --> 03:02.380
Thank you very much.

03:02.440 --> 03:04.410
Hot springs!

03:04.410 --> 03:05.940
Is that place supposed to be fun?

03:06.210 --> 03:08.380
Well, it's a place where you'll get to relax.

03:09.220 --> 03:11.890
I wanted the Autumn Harvest Pack more.

03:11.890 --> 03:14.380
You're still brooding over that?

03:14.760 --> 03:17.160
I thought the prize only included two tickets...

03:17.730 --> 03:21.060
I don't know how to thank you
for letting us join, too.

03:21.060 --> 03:22.150
It's okay.

03:23.060 --> 03:26.690
Now that I think about it,
we never took a family trip.

03:28.240 --> 03:32.040
I'm glad I won't have to cook
tonight or tomorrow morning.

03:32.040 --> 03:33.870
I'll finally get to relax!

03:36.580 --> 03:40.280
There's ice cream! And chocolate! They look good!

03:40.280 --> 03:41.320
I'm not buying it.

03:41.320 --> 03:42.040
But!

03:42.850 --> 03:44.490
I need to go to the toilet.

03:44.490 --> 03:45.880
Let me go with you.

03:49.160 --> 03:51.990
Hold on, Ko! I'll go with him.

03:51.990 --> 03:53.190
I can't allow that.

03:55.100 --> 03:56.660
I'm terribly sorry.

03:56.660 --> 03:58.770
It's difficult to move about with the train shaking.

03:58.770 --> 04:00.530
I want another lunchbox!

04:03.370 --> 04:06.500
I hope I'll get to relax...

04:10.680 --> 04:13.010
Welcome.

04:13.280 --> 04:14.770
Yes, hello.

04:15.050 --> 04:16.480
Hello.

04:16.780 --> 04:18.190
Oh, my. A shrine maiden?

04:18.190 --> 04:20.360
No, I am a Mamorime.

04:20.360 --> 04:22.690
It's just that we have a priestess in our family.

04:24.330 --> 04:26.450
Where's the food?

04:26.530 --> 04:28.690
Didn't you just eat a bunch of lunchboxes earlier?

04:30.130 --> 04:35.540
I was so naïve to think I could
relax with Ku and Ko here...

04:35.670 --> 04:38.140
The rest of your group has already arrived.

04:38.610 --> 04:40.400
Group?

04:41.080 --> 04:42.040
Right over there.

04:44.750 --> 04:45.540
Hey!

04:46.480 --> 04:47.820
Grandma!

04:47.820 --> 04:48.910
Uncle Tatsuhiko...

04:50.520 --> 04:51.750
It's been a while.

04:52.590 --> 04:56.080
You seem to be doing well, Noboru. Toru.

04:56.290 --> 04:56.880
Yeah.

05:04.400 --> 05:09.170
We heard you were going to a hot spring
so Grandma said she wanted to go, too.

05:09.170 --> 05:11.300
Dad! Why did you tell them?

05:11.570 --> 05:13.940
Why not? The more the merrier, right?

05:14.080 --> 05:16.510
It's the other way around.

05:16.510 --> 05:19.210
I get too nervous to even
talk when Grandma's around.

05:19.450 --> 05:23.750
But Grandma probably wanted to see
Ku-chan and Ko-chan since it's been so long.

05:25.390 --> 05:26.650
Ku-chan.

05:27.020 --> 05:28.650
Why did you turn into a man?

05:29.160 --> 05:31.020
I wanna be in this room.

05:33.260 --> 05:35.890
Being with the Hashirame is suffocating.

05:36.300 --> 05:38.230
You want to go take a bath together?

05:38.230 --> 05:40.560
I have to take a bath with him?

05:40.900 --> 05:45.000
I'm a man right now.
Where's the problem in that?

05:45.370 --> 05:48.930
Go on ahead. We'll join a little bit later.

05:51.010 --> 05:52.880
Let's go to the bath.

05:57.220 --> 06:02.120
It seems the Takagami
brothers are safe for now, Ko.

06:02.460 --> 06:03.250
Yes.

06:03.420 --> 06:07.500
How is the tenko?
Has it been causing trouble again?

06:07.500 --> 06:13.130
Tenko-sama is fulfilling its duty
as their guardian deity very well.

06:13.370 --> 06:19.860
Knowing that whimsical fox, who knows
when it'll place the brothers in danger.

06:20.070 --> 06:21.560
But the tenko-sama is...

06:21.980 --> 06:27.510
Ko. Didn't I tell you to assist the
tenko as well as keep an eye on it?

06:28.920 --> 06:34.320
The tenko Kugen may be compassionate,
but it is also aggressive in nature.

06:34.320 --> 06:35.350
Never forget that.

06:39.460 --> 06:40.090
Yes...

06:53.470 --> 06:57.980
Hurry up and strip, Noboru. Let's get naked!

06:57.980 --> 06:58.970
Get away from me!

06:59.250 --> 07:03.050
I guess this is the first time we'll
take a bath together, Ku-chan.

07:05.120 --> 07:06.090
Ko-chan.

07:06.490 --> 07:08.280
Allow me to wash your back.

07:09.160 --> 07:09.960
It's all right!

07:09.960 --> 07:14.360
Besides, I was ordered by the
Hashirame-sama to keep an eye on you two.

07:14.360 --> 07:15.760
We'll be fine!

07:15.900 --> 07:16.860
But...

07:19.770 --> 07:21.500
Toru! Let's come back later!

07:21.870 --> 07:22.970
Come on, Ko!

07:22.970 --> 07:23.660
Ku, you too.

07:26.310 --> 07:28.300
H-Hey, wait!

07:30.450 --> 07:34.180
What's with you, Noboru?
I wanted to take a bath with everyone.

07:34.480 --> 07:36.120
Not happening!

07:36.120 --> 07:40.250
Noboru has it rough. So much for relaxing.

07:46.030 --> 07:47.290
Play with me.

07:48.560 --> 07:49.760
Play with me.

07:51.670 --> 07:52.720
Can't we?

07:52.900 --> 07:54.330
I don't see why not...

07:54.470 --> 07:55.440
Really?!

07:55.740 --> 07:57.700
But not right now.

08:00.480 --> 08:03.340
Where's your mom and dad?

08:05.380 --> 08:06.240
Nowhere.

08:07.620 --> 08:09.980
I'm alone...

08:11.090 --> 08:12.950
You didn't come here on vacation?

08:12.950 --> 08:14.960
Are you with one of the inn employees?

08:14.960 --> 08:16.920
This is my home.

08:16.920 --> 08:18.190
Oh, really?

08:18.530 --> 08:19.550
Play with me?

08:20.430 --> 08:24.020
I guess you don't have anyone to
play with because they're so busy...

08:25.570 --> 08:27.060
How about a little later?

08:27.340 --> 08:29.700
I need to drop off my bath stuff at my room first.

08:29.700 --> 08:33.170
Then come to the Balloon Flower Room later.
I'll be waiting.

08:33.170 --> 08:33.970
And um...

08:34.310 --> 08:35.640
My name is Toru.

08:37.950 --> 08:40.240
Toru-oniichan...

08:40.820 --> 08:42.250
See you later.

08:52.530 --> 08:54.590
I want to stay in your room, Noboru.

08:55.400 --> 08:57.100
Stop being so stubborn!

08:57.100 --> 08:58.930
If you don't let me, I'm not going back.

09:00.940 --> 09:02.440
Geez.

09:02.440 --> 09:04.370
I'm going to go out to the spa-town.

09:04.640 --> 09:06.040
The spa-town?

09:06.040 --> 09:08.200
It's where they sell souvenirs and stuff.

09:08.680 --> 09:10.870
Souvenirs? Like food?

09:13.380 --> 09:15.280
I wanna go, too!

09:15.520 --> 09:18.790
Come on. Take me with you, Noboru.

09:18.790 --> 09:21.020
Why do you always turn into a
woman when you want something?!

09:21.260 --> 09:22.720
Just go and have fun.

09:22.720 --> 09:23.850
Toru-sama.

09:24.530 --> 09:26.630
Do you want to come, too?

09:26.630 --> 09:31.000
No. I'll stay here.
There's something I have to do.

09:31.630 --> 09:33.230
Then I will stay as well.

09:33.230 --> 09:35.570
You might as well go with them, Ko-chan.

09:35.940 --> 09:36.800
But...

09:36.800 --> 09:39.830
It's okay. Grandma is here, anyway.

09:40.110 --> 09:41.610
So what are you doing?

09:41.610 --> 09:44.540
I made plans to play with a girl.

09:44.650 --> 09:46.880
What?!

09:47.550 --> 09:51.210
Oh? That would make Mamorime a third wheel.

09:51.620 --> 09:52.950
I-I didn't mean it that way...

09:53.120 --> 09:55.490
So who's this girl?!

09:55.560 --> 09:59.420
Let's go, Noboru. Mamorime, you too.

09:59.490 --> 10:01.560
- Hey! Let me go, Ku!

10:01.560 --> 10:02.820
- I understand.
- Hey! Let me go, Ku!

10:03.400 --> 10:03.800
- Toru, What kind of girl is she?! Tell me!

10:03.800 --> 10:06.370
- Noboru-sama may need the assistance...
- Toru, What kind of girl is she?! Tell me!

10:06.370 --> 10:08.160
...so I'll go with him.
- Toru, What kind of girl is she?! Tell me!

10:08.500 --> 10:09.990
See you later.

10:20.720 --> 10:23.520
These smell sweet! What are they?!

10:23.520 --> 10:25.310
Those are hot springs manju.

10:25.620 --> 10:26.850
That Toru...

10:27.250 --> 10:30.390
I don't have a girlfriend yet, and he's already...

10:30.390 --> 10:32.590
Manjus! Manjus! Manjus!

10:32.590 --> 10:34.330
Would you like to sample some?

10:34.330 --> 10:35.960
I get to eat these?!

10:40.600 --> 10:45.310
This is amazing! Noboru!
You get to sample stuff everywhere!

10:45.310 --> 10:46.640
We should pretend we don't know her.

10:47.480 --> 10:48.440
Noboru-chan.

10:51.450 --> 10:53.710
Noboru! I'm going to eat all of them!

11:02.060 --> 11:06.190
Where's that Balloon Flower Room?

11:06.190 --> 11:07.420
Toru-oniichan...

11:08.630 --> 11:10.100
Toru-oniichan.

11:10.100 --> 11:11.120
Where are you?

11:11.300 --> 11:14.630
Toru-oniichan... Toru-oniichan...

11:14.840 --> 11:16.000
Over there?

11:21.910 --> 11:21.940
Balloon Flower Room

11:21.940 --> 11:23.080
Balloon Flower Room
Here it is!

11:23.080 --> 11:23.700
Balloon Flower Room

12:05.020 --> 12:06.850
Toru-oniichan.

12:08.290 --> 12:09.380
Who are you?

12:12.060 --> 12:13.080
Toru...

12:14.230 --> 12:14.960
Huh?!

12:15.060 --> 12:19.470
Did I give away my name again?!

12:20.270 --> 12:23.130
Let's play... Let's play...

12:31.410 --> 12:36.020
Tenko-sama. You seem to be enjoying
your time in the human world.

12:36.020 --> 12:37.620
Shut up, Hashirame.

12:37.620 --> 12:39.880
Come on. We're here on vacation, right?

12:40.390 --> 12:42.290
Let's just take it easy...

12:47.090 --> 12:48.650
How am I supposed to?

12:52.530 --> 12:55.470
The caramel! The caramel box just won't fall!

13:03.210 --> 13:04.700
That's amazing.

13:06.250 --> 13:07.310
Here you go.

13:10.890 --> 13:11.780
Want some?

13:12.050 --> 13:13.210
No, thank you.

13:15.560 --> 13:16.420
Excuse me...

13:17.730 --> 13:22.660
If you are all here, does that mean
Toru-sama is alone at the inn?

13:23.330 --> 13:25.420
I thought Toru-chan was with you.

13:25.770 --> 13:28.000
Didn't Toru go back to our room?

13:28.270 --> 13:29.790
I guess we just missed him.

13:30.470 --> 13:32.100
I want to go back to check on him.

13:50.120 --> 13:51.180
What is this?

13:52.030 --> 13:54.490
There's a powerful yokai here.

13:56.000 --> 13:58.830
I didn't sense anything when we left the inn...

13:59.030 --> 14:00.730
Find Toru.

14:05.840 --> 14:07.070
Toru-sama!

14:07.880 --> 14:09.900
Toru! Where are you?!

14:24.490 --> 14:26.290
What was that?

14:37.300 --> 14:39.530
Uh... What's going on?

14:39.770 --> 14:41.400
Noboru-sama, get down!

14:48.620 --> 14:52.140
A manju... A huge one at that...

14:59.130 --> 15:00.060
Ko!

15:05.130 --> 15:06.500
Toru!

15:06.830 --> 15:08.270
Toru-chan!

15:09.040 --> 15:09.930
He might be in here.

15:10.170 --> 15:11.870
Men's Bath

15:12.410 --> 15:13.700
Hey, Ku-chan!

15:25.950 --> 15:29.750
I'm sorry. She's just not
used to being in Japan yet...

15:30.560 --> 15:31.320
What's that?

15:32.730 --> 15:33.620
Toru...

15:37.000 --> 15:37.760
Ku-chan!

15:55.420 --> 15:56.680
So it's you...

15:57.280 --> 15:58.440
Listen, child...

15:58.790 --> 16:02.190
Playing tricks will get you punished.

16:07.560 --> 16:09.860
No!

16:17.270 --> 16:20.010
I should have stayed by his side to protect him...

16:20.010 --> 16:21.570
It's not your fault, Ko.

16:21.740 --> 16:22.610
But...

16:27.350 --> 16:28.680
Toru is in here?!

16:33.390 --> 16:34.350
It won't open...

16:40.090 --> 16:41.890
Noboru-sama, watch out!

16:50.000 --> 16:51.060
Toru.

16:52.010 --> 16:53.200
Toru-sama.

16:54.880 --> 16:56.270
Get a hold of yourself.

16:57.640 --> 16:58.580
Toru!

16:58.580 --> 16:59.880
Are you okay, Toru-chan?!

17:03.950 --> 17:07.510
Seems like she absorbed Toru's life energy.

17:12.930 --> 17:15.220
Get Toru back to normal, kid!

17:17.770 --> 17:19.600
Stop bullying me!

17:20.500 --> 17:22.990
Tenko-sama, your face looks too freakish.

17:24.870 --> 17:25.800
Yeah, yeah...

17:26.040 --> 17:27.910
Get him back to normal, okay?

17:44.790 --> 17:45.590
Toru!

17:46.390 --> 17:47.590
Noboru...

17:51.900 --> 17:52.700
Toru!

17:53.670 --> 17:55.660
Grandma...

17:56.970 --> 17:58.270
You're all right...

17:59.510 --> 18:02.440
Ko! Why did you let him out of your sight?!

18:04.410 --> 18:05.840
I am terribly sorry...

18:08.750 --> 18:09.720
Grandma...

18:11.650 --> 18:14.380
Don't get mad at Ko-chan...

18:15.160 --> 18:18.750
I was the one who told her to go with Noboru...

18:20.690 --> 18:21.790
Toru-sama...

18:29.440 --> 18:31.030
Toru-oniichan.

18:33.070 --> 18:34.800
She's a Zashiki-warashi.

18:35.440 --> 18:37.600
A Zashiki-warashi?

18:38.450 --> 18:41.110
She was the one who absorbed your energy.

18:41.980 --> 18:47.120
I just wanted to play...
No one ever plays with me.

18:47.120 --> 18:53.220
So that makes it right for you to suck the life out
of the one boy kind enough to play with you?

18:58.370 --> 19:05.240
I just thought, with Toru-oniichan's powers,
the toys would play with me...

19:05.910 --> 19:08.900
It's okay, Ku-chan.

19:09.440 --> 19:10.380
Toru.

19:10.910 --> 19:15.640
Let's all play together. We're here on vacation!

19:16.820 --> 19:19.190
Yeah. Let's have some fun.

19:19.190 --> 19:22.050
I guess now's the only time we
can play with the Zashiki-warashi.

19:23.060 --> 19:24.420
Understood.

19:26.190 --> 19:28.820
Toru, you forgot this in the changing room.

19:30.260 --> 19:31.560
Thanks.

19:32.030 --> 19:32.860
What's that?

19:33.970 --> 19:36.870
Ku-chan made it for me with her own fur.

19:36.870 --> 19:39.030
It's so evil spirits can't come near me.

19:39.210 --> 19:40.470
Oh?

19:41.070 --> 19:43.670
It doesn't work if you don't wear it.

19:44.110 --> 19:45.240
Right!

19:52.390 --> 19:53.480
Grandma...

19:55.160 --> 19:56.320
We'll be all right.

19:57.620 --> 20:01.650
Ku and Ko are protecting us just fine.

20:02.260 --> 20:08.530
They might be troublemakers from time to
time, but you don't have worry about us.

20:14.610 --> 20:19.050
Noboru-chan and Toru-chan are growing up so fast.

20:19.710 --> 20:20.910
Yup.

20:33.730 --> 20:35.090
Why Japanese badminton?

20:35.400 --> 20:36.300
Noboru!

20:36.300 --> 20:36.850
Ow!

20:39.730 --> 20:41.500
Zashiki-warashi said she liked this game!

20:41.800 --> 20:43.790
All right! Me next!

20:44.500 --> 20:45.270
There!

20:45.710 --> 20:46.640
Eat this!

20:48.380 --> 20:51.040
Ku! I'm going to have to pay for that!

20:51.040 --> 20:52.050
My turn.

20:52.050 --> 20:53.710
Just stop!

20:56.180 --> 20:58.550
Again?!

21:09.300 --> 21:15.760
Sora no hate ga tsunagaru basho wo
Where the horizon meets the earth,

21:16.240 --> 21:23.440
no ni saku hana wa mada kitto shiranai
The flower growing in the wild remains unaware.

21:24.810 --> 21:31.310
Kokoyori ii sekai ga aruto
While thinking that there
is a world better than this.

21:31.450 --> 21:39.090
Kokoro wa itsumo hane wo hirogetagaru
They always desire to spread
the wings of their hearts.

21:39.990 --> 21:46.990
Yume dakede owarasenai
Don't let it end as just a dream,

21:47.600 --> 21:54.100
chansu ga aru hazusa
There's always a chance.

21:54.340 --> 22:01.750
Daijoubu bokura ha hitori janai
It's all right. We are not alone.

22:01.750 --> 22:09.390
Kaze ga nanika wo iouto shiteru
The winds are telling us something.

22:09.390 --> 22:17.060
Daijoubu kanarazau umaku yareru
It's all right. You can do it.

22:17.060 --> 22:28.270
Omoi wa itsuka jibun wo kaeru michi ni naru
Those dreams are a path you'll change yourself.

22:39.990 --> 22:43.550
We may have won the trip,
but we ended up spending so much money.

22:44.160 --> 22:45.950
Still, it was fun.

22:49.500 --> 22:51.520
Noboru-sama, Toru-sama.

22:51.670 --> 22:55.230
I thought you would be tired, so I made
this bath into what they call a jacuzzi.

22:58.470 --> 23:00.200
This is great!

23:00.870 --> 23:02.840
This isn't bad at all...

23:03.840 --> 23:04.830
In that case...

23:14.990 --> 23:16.890
How do you like my waterfall bath technique?

23:17.890 --> 23:22.850
There are limits to everything!

23:25.000 --> 23:25.470
Next Time

23:25.470 --> 23:28.670
Next Time
On the day of the Culture Festival,
Tenko-san came to school in uniform.

23:28.670 --> 23:31.370
Next Time
There's still no way of knowing how his
relationship with Ko-chan will turn out either.

23:31.370 --> 23:34.070
Next Time
It seems like I'm getting yet another rival...

23:34.070 --> 23:34.370
Next Time

23:34.370 --> 23:35.180
Next Time
Next time, "Our Fox Deity,
Becomes a High School Student."

